{"version":1,"slug":"Others__Quantitative_Aptitude_-_SSC_Super_Practice_61_(20Q)","path":"Others/Quantitative Aptitude - SSC Super Practice 61 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"Quantitative Aptitude - SSC Super Practice 61 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = 21 and x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy = 7, then what is the value of (x/y) + (y/x)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = 21 &#2324;&#2352; x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup> - xy = 7 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x/y) + (y/x) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5/4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-3/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-3/2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-5/2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-5/2</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup> = 21</p><p>and x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy = 7--------(1)</p><p>x<sup>4</sup> + y<sup>4</sup>+x<sup>2</sup>y<sup>2</sup>= (x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>  -  xy)(x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>+xy)</p><p>21 = 7 * (x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>+xy)</p><p>x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup> + xy =3 ------(2)</p><p>From eq(1) and eq(2)  - </p><p>x<sup>2</sup>+ y<sup>2</sup>=5 and xy = -2</p><p>So, (x/y) + (y/x) = (x<sup>2</sup>+y<sup>2</sup>)/xy=5/(-2)</p><p>= -5/2</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 3a + 2b = 27 and 27a<sup>3 </sup>+ 8b<sup>3 </sup>= 1458, then find 2ab.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 3a + 2b = 27 &#2324;&#2352; 27a<sup>3 </sup>+ 8b<sup>3 </sup>= 1458, &#2340;&#2379; 2ab &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">72</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">72</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">70</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">70</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">77</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">77</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">75</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>As we know,</p><p>(3a + 2b)<sup>3</sup> = 27a<sup>3</sup> + 8b<sup>3</sup> + 3 * 3a * 2b(3a + 2b)</p><p>27<sup>3</sup> = 1458 + 18ab * 27</p><p>=&gt; 19683 = 1458 + 486ab</p><p>=&gt; 19683 - 1458 = 486ab</p><p>=&gt; 18225 = 486ab</p><p>=&gt; ab = 18225 / 486</p><p>=&gt; ab = 37.5</p><p>=&gt; 2ab = 2  X  37.5</p><p>=&gt; 2ab = 75</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x - y = 11 and <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x</span></div> - <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>y</span></div> = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>11</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>24</span></div>, then the value of x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> y<sup>2</sup> &quest;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x - y = 11 &#2324;&#2352; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x</span></div> - <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>y</span></div> = <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>11</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>24</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3</sup> + x<sup>2</sup> y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1331</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1331</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1105</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1105</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1307</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1307</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1115</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1115</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>x - y = 11</p><p><img border=0 width=16 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image028.png\"> - <img border=0 width=16 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image029.png\"> = <img border=0 width=24 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image024.png\"></p><p><img border=0 width=76 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image030.png\"></p><p><img border=0 width=68 height=39 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image031.png\"></p><p>xy = -24</p><p>Since (x-y)<sup>3</sup> = x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3</sup> - 3xy(x-y)</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> = 11<sup>3</sup> + 3*(-24) * (11)</p><p>= 11(121  -  72)</p><p>= 11 * 49</p><p>= 539</p><p><img border=0 width=19 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image032.png\">- <img border=0 width=19 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image033.png\"> + <img border=0 width=33 height=24 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21086/image034.png\"> = 539 + (-24)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 539 + 576</p><p>= 1115</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If x + y = 3 and <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>y</span></div> = - <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>10</span></div>, then the value of x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> is&#58;&nbsp;</div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>If x + y = 3 &#2324;&#2352; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>x</span></div> + <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>1</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>y</span></div> = - <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>3</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center'>10</span></div> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</div></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">29</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">29</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">28</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">26</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">26</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">34</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">34</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x + y = 3</p><p>(1/x) + (1/y) =(-3/10)</p><p>10(x + y) = - 3xy</p><p>10*3 = -3xy</p><p>xy = -10</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = (x + y)<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 3<sup>2</sup>  -  2 * (-10)</p><p>= 9 + 20</p><p>= 29</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2a - b = 3 and 8a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> = 999, then find the value of 4a<sup>2 </sup>&#8722; b<sup>2</sup></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2a - b = 3 &#2324;&#2352; 8a<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> = 999, &#2340;&#2379; 4a<sup>2 </sup>&#8722; b<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;</span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">63</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">63</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">65</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">65</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">61</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">61</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">67</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">67</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Given: 2a - b = 3</p><p>8<sup>3</sup> - b<sup>3</sup> = 999</p><p>Factor the second equation (difference of cubes): (2a - b)(4a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178;) = 999</p><p>Substitute (2a - b) = 3: 4a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178; = 333</p><p>Square the first equation: (2a - b)&#178; = 9</p><p>4a&#178; - 4ab + b&#178; = 9</p><p>Subtracting the equations: (4a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178;) - (4a&#178; - 4ab + b&#178;) = 333 - 9</p><p>6ab = 324</p><p>ab = 54</p><p>Find 4a&#178; - b&#178;: 4a&#178; - b&#178; = (2a - b)(2a + b) = 3  X  (2a + b)</p><p>To find (2a + b), first solve equations and find a = 6, b = 9: Then, 2a + b = 12 + 9 = 21</p><p>Therefore: 4a&#178; - b&#178; = 3  X  21 = 63</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If m + n = 24, then (m  -  16)<sup>3</sup> + (n  -  8)<sup>3</sup> is _____.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; m + n = 24, &#2340;&#2379; (m - 16)<sup>3</sup> + (n - 8)<sup>3</sup> _____ &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">40</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">40</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">576</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">576</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">320</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">320</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Let m + n = 24</p><p>=&gt; (a + b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + 3ab(a + b)</p><p>Let a = m - 16 and b = n - 8</p><p>Given m + n = 24, we need to express m and n in terms of a and b.</p><p>=&gt; m = a + 16</p><p>=&gt; n = b + 8</p><p>=&gt; (a + 16) + (b + 8) = 24</p><p>=&gt; a + b + 24 = 24</p><p>=&gt; a + b = 0</p><p>=&gt; b = -a</p><p>Now, substitute b in the given expression:</p><p>(a - 16)<sup>3</sup> + (n - 8)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup> + (-a)<sup>3</sup></p><p>=&gt; a<sup>3</sup> + (-a)<sup>3</sup></p><p>=&gt; a<sup>3</sup> - a<sup>3</sup></p><p>=&gt; 0</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x - y = 25 and xy = 444, compute the value of x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup>.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x - y = 25 &#2324;&#2352; xy = 444, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> - y<sup>3</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">48,925</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">48,925</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">42,985</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">42,985</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">28,495</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28,495</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">26,725</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">26,725</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x - y = 25 and xy = 444</p><p>(x - y)<sup>2</sup> = 25<sup>2</sup> </p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup>  -  2xy = 625</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> = 625 + 2*444 = 1513</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> = (x  -  y)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + xy)</p><p>= 25(1513 + 444)</p><p>= 25  X  1957 </p><p>= 48925 </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2&radic;2x<sup>3</sup>  -  3&radic;3y<sup>3 </sup>= (&radic;2x  -  &radic;3y) (Ax<sup>2</sup> - Bxy + Cy<sup>2</sup>), then the value of (A<sup>2</sup> + B<sup>2</sup> + C<sup>2</sup>) is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2&radic;2x<sup>3</sup> - 3&radic;3y<sup>3 </sup>= (&radic;2x - &radic;3y) (Ax<sup>2</sup> - Bxy + Cy<sup>2</sup>), &#2340;&#2379; (A<sup>2</sup> + B<sup>2</sup> + C<sup>2</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">11</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">11</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">19</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">19</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>2&radic;2x<sup>3</sup>  -  3&radic;3y<sup>3 </sup>= (&radic;2x  -  &radic;3y) (Ax<sup>2</sup> - Bxy + Cy<sup>2</sup>)</p><p><b>We know that: </b>a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup> = (a  -  b) (a<sup>2</sup> + ab + b<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>(&radic;2x  -  &radic;3y) (2x<sup>2</sup> + &radic;6xy + 3y<sup>2</sup>) = (&radic;2x  -  &radic;3y) (Ax<sup>2</sup> - Bxy + Cy<sup>2</sup>)</p><p>After comparing:</p><p>A = 2, B = -&radic;6, and C = 3</p><p>Now,</p><p>A<sup>2</sup> + B<sup>2</sup> + C<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 2<sup>2</sup> + (-&radic;6)<sup>2</sup> + 3<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 4 + 6 + 9</p><p>= 19</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The relation between K1 and K2 for which the system of linear equations K<sub>1</sub>x + 3y = 8 and 4x + K<sub>2</sub>y = 16 represents Coincident lines, is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>K1 &#2324;&#2352; K2 &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; K<sub>1</sub>x + 3y = 8 &#2324;&#2352; 4x + K<sub>2</sub>y = 16 &#2360;&#2306;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2352;&#2375;&#2326;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">K<sub>2</sub> = 3K<sub>1</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">K<sub>2</sub> = 3K<sub>1</sub></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">K<sub>2</sub> + 3K<sub>1</sub> = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">K<sub>2</sub> + 3K<sub>1</sub> = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">K<sub>2</sub> = K<sub>1</sub></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">K<sub>2</sub> = K<sub>1</sub></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">K<sub>1</sub>+ K<sub>2</sub> = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">K<sub>1</sub>+ K<sub>2</sub> = 0</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>We have the equation as:-</p><p>K<sub>1</sub>x + 3y  -  8 = 0</p><p>4x + K<sub>2</sub>y  -  16 = 0</p><p>For two lines to be coincident, the ratios of their corresponding coefficients must be equal:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a2 = b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub> = c<sub>1</sub>/c<sub>2</sub></p><p>Where the equations are of the form:</p><p>a1x + b<sub>1</sub>y + c<sub>1</sub> = 0</p><p>a<sub>2</sub>x + b<sub>2</sub>y + c<sub>2</sub> = 0</p><p>so we have:-</p><p>K<sub>1</sub>/4 = 3/K<sub>2</sub> = -8/-16</p><p>-8/-16 = 1/2.</p><p>K<sub>1</sub>/4 = 1/2</p><p>K<sub>1</sub> = 4  X  1/2 = 2</p><p>And,</p><p>3/K<sub>2</sub> = 1/2</p><p>K<sub>2</sub> = 3  X  2 = 6</p><p>So K<sub>2</sub> = 3K<sub>1</sub>.</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Find the value of 'k' for which the system of equations 4x+6y=7 and 6x+(k+4)y-21=0 has a unique solution.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>'k' &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2361; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; 4x+6y=7 &#2324;&#2352; 6x+(k+4)y-21=0 &#2325;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2309;&#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2361;&#2354; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">K = 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">K = 5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">k &#8800; 5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">k &#8800; 5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">k = 7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">k = 7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">k &#8800; 7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">k &#8800; 7</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>We know by a pair of linear equation:-</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>x + b<sub>1</sub>y = c<sub>1</sub></p><p>a<sub>2</sub>x + b<sub>2</sub>y = c<sub>2</sub></p><p>The condition for a unique solution is:</p><p>a<sub>1</sub>/a<sub>2</sub>&#8800;b<sub>1</sub>/b<sub>2</sub></p><p>we have the equation as:-</p><p>4x + 6y  -  7 = 0</p><p>6x + (k+4)y  -  21= 0</p><p>Here a<sub>1</sub>=4, b<sub>1</sub>=6 and a<sub>2</sub>=6 and b<sub>2</sub>=(k+4)</p><p>So :</p><p>4/6 &#8800; 6/(k+4)</p><p>4k+16&#8800; 36</p><p>4k&#8800;20</p><p>k&#8800;5</p><p>option (b) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x = 3y + 4, then what is the value of (x<sup>3</sup> - 27y<sup>3</sup>  -  36xy)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 3y + 4, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>3</sup> - 27y<sup>3</sup> - 36xy) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">27</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">27</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">64</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">64</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>x = 3y + 4</p><p>x  -  3y = 4</p><p>(x  -  3y)<sup>3</sup> = 4<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  27y<sup>3</sup>  -  3*x*3y(x  -  3y) = 64</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  27y<sup>3</sup>  -  9xy*4 = 64</p><p>x<sup>3</sup>  -  27y<sup>3</sup>  -  36xy = 64</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 148 and ab = 54, then find the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a + b</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a - b</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 148  &#2324;&#2352;   ab = 54, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  &nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a + b</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a - b</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">8/&radic;10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8/&radic;10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2/&radic;10</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2/&radic;10</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8&radic;7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8&radic;7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5&radic;3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5&radic;3</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2 </sup>+ 2ab</p><p>According to question,</p><p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> = 148 + 2 * 54 </p><p>=&gt; (a + b)<sup>2</sup> = 148 + 108 = 256</p><p>(a + b) = 16</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>  -  2ab</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = 148  -  2 * 54</p><p>=&gt; 148  -  108 </p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> = 40 or 2&radic;10</p><p>(a+b)/(a-b) = 16/2&radic;10 = 8/&radic;10</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Given a linear equation in two variables: 5x + 7y - 8 = 0, which of the following linear equations, along with the given equation, forms a system of linear equations having no solution?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2379; &#2330;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2319;&#2325; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2342;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;: 5x + 7y - 8 = 0, &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;, &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341;, &#2352;&#2376;&#2326;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2339;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2348;&#2344;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2379;&#2312; &#2361;&#2354; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">5x + 7y - 16 = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x + 7y - 16 = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">7x + 5y - 8 = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">7x + 5y - 8 = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5x - 7y - 8 = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5x - 7y - 8 = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">10x + 14y - 16 = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">10x + 14y - 16 = 0</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Two lines are parallel (and have no solution) if their coefficients of x and y are proportional but the constant terms differ. i.e their slopes must be equal and also should have different intercept</p><p>Slope of equation is:-</p><p>5x + 7y - 8 = 0</p><p>Slope = -5/7</p><p>So Let's check slope of each given equation:-</p><p>1) 5x + 7y - 16 = 0</p><p>Slope = -5/7 (same slope as the given equation and different intercept)</p><p>2) 7x + 5y - 8 = 0</p><p>Slope = -7/5 (different slope)</p><p>3) 5x - 7y - 8 = 0</p><p>Slope = 5/7 (different slope)</p><p>4) 10x + 14y - 16 = 0</p><p>Slope = -10/14 = -5/7 (same slope as the given equation, but same intercept)</p><p>Option (a) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">b</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">b</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp;= 1, a &ne; 0, b &ne; 0, then find the value of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3ab</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">b</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">b</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a</span></div>&nbsp;= 1, a &ne; 0, b &ne; 0, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup></span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3ab</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-3</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>a/b + b/a = 1</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = ab ----(1)</p><p>Now,</p><p>(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup>)/3ab = (a + b)( a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>  -  ab)/3ab</p><p>= (a + b)(ab  -  ab)/3ab</p><p>= 0</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The coefficient of x in (x  -  3y)<sup>3 </sup>is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(x - 3y)<sup>3</sup> &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; x &#2325;&#2366; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3y<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3y<sup>2</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\"><sup> </sup>27y<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><sup> </sup>27y<sup>2</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-27y<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-27y<sup>2</sup></span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-3y<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-3y<sup>2</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>We know, (a  -  b)<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup>  -  b<sup>3</sup>  -  3ab(a  -  b)</p><p>(x  -  3y)<sup>3 </sup>= x<sup>3</sup> - (3y)<sup>3</sup>  -  3x. 3y(x - 3y)</p><p>= x<sup>3</sup> - 27y<sup>3</sup>  -  9xy (x  -  3y)</p><p>= x<sup>3</sup> - 27y<sup>3</sup>  -  9x<sup>2</sup>y  -  27xy<sup>2</sup></p><p>The coefficient of x = 27y<sup>2</sup></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + 3 = 0, then find the value of x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> - 9xy + 9.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + 3 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> - 9xy + 9 &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-36</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-36</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">36</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">36</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>x + y + 3 = 0</p><p>x + y = -3</p><p>(x + y)<sup>3</sup> = (-3)<sup>3</sup></p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + 3xy (x + y) = -27</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + 3xy * (-3) = -27</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3 </sup> -  9xy + 9 = -27 + 9</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup>  -  9xy + 9 = -18</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The factors of x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4y - 4xy - 2x - 8 are</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4y - 4xy - 2x - 8 &#2325;&#2375; &#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2344;&#2326;&#2339;&#2381;&#2337; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(x - 2y - 4)(x - 2y + 2)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(x - 2y - 4)(x - 2y + 2)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(x<sup>2 </sup> - 2y - 4)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2y + 2)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(x<sup>2 </sup> - 2y - 4)(x<sup>2</sup> - 2y + 2)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(x + 2y - 4)(x + 2y + 2)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(x + 2y - 4)(x + 2y + 2)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(x<sup>2 </sup> - 2y - 4)(x<sup>2 </sup>+ 2y + 2)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(x<sup>2 </sup> - 2y - 4)(x<sup>2 </sup>+ 2y + 2)</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p><img width=17 height=19 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21005/image042.png\"> + <img width=27 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21005/image041.png\"> + 4y  -  4xy  -  2x  -  8</p><p>= (x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup>  -  4xy) - 2(x  -  2y)  -  8</p><p>= (x  -  2y)<sup>2</sup> - 4(x  -  2y) + 2(x  -  2y)  -  8</p><p>= (x  -  2y)[x  -  2y  -  4] + 2 [x  -  2y  -  4]</p><p>= (x  -  2y - 4) (x  -  2y + 2)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><div>&nbsp;If a + b = 1, then find the value of:&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">b<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">ab</span></div></div></p><p></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><div>&nbsp;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367;  a + b = 1, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;  :&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">a<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">1</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">b<sup>2</sup></span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">ab</span></div></div></p><p></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1/(a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/(a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup>)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/ab</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/ab</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/a<sup>2</sup>b</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a<sup>2</sup>b</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">a/ab<sup>2</sup></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">a/ab<sup>2</sup></span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Starting with the identity (a + b)&#178; = a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178;, and substituting a + b = 1:</p><p>(1)&#178; = a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178;</p><p>=&gt; 1 = a&#178; + 2ab + b&#178;</p><p>The expression to simplify is:</p><p>1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; + 2/ab</p><p>We can rewrite 1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; as:</p><p>1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; = (a&#178; + b&#178;) / (a&#178;b&#178;)</p><p>Using the identity a&#178; + b&#178; = (a + b)&#178; - 2ab:</p><p>a&#178; + b&#178; = 1 - 2ab</p><p>Substitute this into the expression:</p><p>1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; = (1 - 2ab) / (a&#178;b&#178;)</p><p>The full expression becomes:</p><p>1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; + 2/ab = [(1 - 2ab) / (a&#178;b&#178;)] + 2/ab</p><p>We can simplify this further:</p><p>1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; + 2/ab = (1 - 2ab + 2ab) / (a&#178;b&#178;)</p><p>=&gt; 1/a&#178; + 1/b&#178; + 2/ab = 1 / (a&#178;b&#178;)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the value of (a + b)<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)<sup>2</sup>?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(a + b)<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)<sup>2 </sup>&#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2(a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2(a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4(a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4(a<sup>2 </sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8ab</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8ab</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4ab</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4ab</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p><img width=49 height=27 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21005/image015.png\"><i>  -  </i><img width=47 height=27 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21005/image016.png\"></p><p>= (a + b + a  -  b) (a + b  -  a + b)</p><p>= 2a * 2b</p><p>= 4ab</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x<sup>2</sup> + 8y<sup>2</sup> + 12y  -  4xy + 9 = 0, then the value of (7x + 8y) is:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x<sup>2</sup> + 8y<sup>2</sup> + 12y - 4xy + 9 = 0 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (7x + 8y) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-33</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-33</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">33</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">33</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>x<sup>2</sup> + 8y<sup>2</sup> + 12y  -  4xy + 9 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 12y  -  4xy + 9 = 0</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup>  -  4xy + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 12y + 9 = 0</p><p>(x  -  2y)<sup>2</sup> + (2y + 3)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>When, (2y + 3)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>Then, y = -3/2</p><p>When, (x  -  2y)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>Then, x = 2y = -3</p><p>Now, the value of (7x + 8y) = 7 * (-3) + 8 * (-3/2) = -21  -  12 = -33</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}